  "_readme": "Curated list of photo keys (paths relative to photos/) that are drawings — plans, sketches, blueprints, CAD. Edit freely and re-run npm run catalog. catalog.mjs uses this to reclassify: a modern 'now' photo listed here becomes era 'drawings-now' (strip section right after the Now construction); a scanned 'then' photo becomes era 'drawings' (last strip section, right after the Then construction). Applied after construction.json, so a key listed in both reads as a drawing. Whole folders of drawings don't need to be listed here — use frontmatter 'drawingFolders' (scanned paper, photos/scanned/<folder>) or 'cadFolders' (born-digital, photos/drawings/<folder>) instead.",
